<h1>Format Annotations</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">This command is accessible from</span> <span lang="EN-GB" class="Path" style="font-weight:bold; font-style:italic;"><i><b>Annotation</b></i></span><b style="font-style:italic;"><i style="font-style:italic; font-weight:bold;"><span class="Path">s</span> &gt;</i></b> <i>Format</i> in <span class="Mode">Inspection</span> <span lang="EN-US">mode or from the</span> <b style="font-weight:normal;"><span class="Path">annotation context</span> menu</b> <span lang="EN-US">in</span> <span class="Mode">Edit</span> <span lang="EN-US">annotation mode.</span></p>
<p class="Description"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> <span lang="EN-US">This command calls the format dialog where you can customize what information to be displayed on the annotations.</span></p>
<p class="Description">&#160;</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span lang="EN-US">Format single annotation</span></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>New annotation</b></span><span lang="EN-US">: While you are in Annotation mode click on the current inspection page to create annotation. The</span> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Edit Annotation</b></span> <span lang="EN-US">dialog will instantly open.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Edit current annotation</b></span><span lang="EN-US">: If you click with the RMB on an existing annotation and choose</span> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Edit</b></span> <span lang="EN-US">from the</span> <span lang="EN-US" style="text-decoration:underline;"><u>Context menu</u></span><span lang="EN-US">, then you can format its appearance.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<table class="TableGrid" style="border:none; border-collapse:separate; left:0px; top:126px; width:757px; border-spacing:0px;" cellspacing="0" width="757">
<col class="whs4">
<col class="whs5">
<tr>
<td valign="top" width="234px" class="whs6">
<p class="whs7"><img src="../images/Image10.gif" width="266px" height="294px" border="0" class="img_whs8" alt=""></p>
</td>
<td valign="top" width="489px" class="whs9">
<p class="parameterstitle"><span lang="EN-US">Annotation text</span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Type the text you want to appear as note for a new annotation or change the existing one.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span lang="EN-US"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Font size</b></span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-US">Sets the font size of the text. Type it manually.</span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span lang="EN-US">Background color...</span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-US">Opens the standard windows dialog for color selection. Choose here the background color for the current annotation.</span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle">Font color...</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-US">Opens the same dialog for color selection. Choose the text color for the current annotation</span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription">&#160;</p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p class="parameterstitle">&#160;</p>
<p class="parameterstitle">Format all annotations in current inspection page</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">If you select <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Format</b></span> option from the <span style="font-weight:bold; font-style:italic;"><i><b>Annotation menu</b></i></span>, then the settings changes will be applied to all annotations in the current inspection page.</p>
<table class="TableGrid" style="border:none; left:0px; top:126px; width:757px; border-spacing:0px;" cellspacing="0" width="757">
<col class="whs4">
<col class="whs5">
<tr>
<td valign="top" width="234px" class="whs6">
<p class="whs7"><img src="../images/Image11.gif" width="266px" height="294px" border="0" class="img_whs8" alt=""></p>
</td>
<td valign="top" width="489px" class="whs9">
<p class="parameterstitle"><span lang="EN-US">Annotation text</span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription">The text field is grayed, because the changes will affect all available annotations in the current page.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span lang="EN-US"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Font size</b></span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-US">Sets the font size of the text. Type the value in the edit box</span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span lang="EN-US">Background color...</span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-US">Opens the standard windows dialog for color selection. Choose here the background color for the annotation.</span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle">Font color...</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-US">Opens the same dialog for color selection. Choose the text color for the annotation</span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span lang="EN-US">Apply to all</span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-US">Check this box to apply the changes to all annotations in the current inspection page.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p>&#160;</p>

